    "name_raw": "Martial Weapon Proficiency",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook",
    "definition_raw": "Choose a type of martial weapon. You understand how to use that type of martial weapon in combat.\n\nBenefit: You make attack rolls with the selected weapon normally (without the non-proficient penalty).\n\nNormal: When using a weapon with which you are not proficient, you take a –4 penalty on attack rolls.\n\nSpecial: Barbarians, fighters, paladins, and rangers are proficient with all martial weapons. They need not select this feat.\n\nYou can gain Martial Weapon Proficiency multiple times. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new type of weapon.",
